// Safe finite protocol verified complete under both `--mode lawful` and `--mode adversarial`:
// even if `MalHost` performs unlawful `cut-link`, `Valid when` prevents double-lease activation.
//! explore-domain: duration = 1, 3
Fact node Identified by N1.
Fact host Identified by H1, H2.
Fact active-lease Identified by node * host.
Fact link-cut Identified by host.

Act grant-lease Actor host Related to node
  Holds when !(Exists host': active-lease(node, host'))
  Valid when !(Exists host': active-lease(node, host'))
  Creates active-lease(node, host) For 3.

Act unlawful-cut-link Actor host
  Holds when False
  Creates link-cut(host).

Invariant single-active-lease
  When (Forall node, host, host':
          !(active-lease(node, host) && active-lease(node, host') && host != host')).
